[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9906.07, "timestamp": "02:45:06", "text": "実際、いい感じに見える。ちょっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9912.07, "timestamp": "02:45:12", "text": "待って、太くしたらどうなる？あぁ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9913.83, "timestamp": "02:45:13", "text": "多すぎる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9924.23, "timestamp": "02:45:24", "text": "にしようと思う。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9926.63, "timestamp": "02:45:26", "text": "よし。ページ背景は再利用可能な"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9934.469, "timestamp": "02:45:34", "text": "よし。ヒーローセクションの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9938.95, "timestamp": "02:45:38", "text": "位置は相対高さ300～"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9941.03, "timestamp": "02:45:41", "text": "400px、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9943.75, "timestamp": "02:45:43", "text": "mageフィットカバー"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9948.55, "timestamp": "02:45:48", "text": "相対。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9952.389, "timestamp": "02:45:52", "text": "待って、これよくわからない。待って、それから[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9959.349, "timestamp": "02:45:59", "text": "ボックスを追加する、"}]